WEBVTT

00:00:00.102 --> 00:00:05.550
This video shows how to send a notification to a whole group of people from your phone.

00:00:07.231 --> 00:00:21.103
Tap the menu button, choose Notifications, then tap the Send tab. At the top is a Run Now box for automatic reminders. Below it, Broadcast to Group is selected, which sends to a whole group.

00:00:30.630 --> 00:00:38.574
Under Use Template, choose Holiday Notice. The title and the message fill in for you, and you can still change them.

00:00:44.018 --> 00:00:52.346
Now choose who receives it. Here the group is All Teachers, and the channel stays In-App, which also reaches their phones.

00:00:54.753 --> 00:01:08.481
Tap Review and Send Broadcast. A box shows the group, the channel and the estimated number of recipients. Tap Confirm Send, and a green message says how many were sent, skipped or failed.

00:01:22.483 --> 00:01:29.179
Your notification has been sent. Everyone in that group can read it in their notifications.
